      "name": "Medic-Tank",
      "username": "Medic-Tank",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-07-26T01:28:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just noticed that throughout her deck her energy spikes are always blue exept for her incap side. The color yellow they then take mirroring Dawn's typical power color is probably not haphazard especially considering Dawn is on the incap.</p><p>Could this indicate that Dawn can affect other mutants (of course return with the dawn already shows effect on others)?</p><p>Could this incap be a mirror to when Magneto stripped the Adamantium out of Wolverine? (it ain't litteraly the same but both times seem like a use of power to get substance or energy out of a body agains't their will) The absolute lack of damage to Knyfe's armor would support a loss of control induced by Dawn.</p><p>I'd like to know your take on all this as you are usually better than me at fishing out conspiracy theories.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:56.687Z",
